      "writtenOn": "2026-09-22T12:42:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Lots of `bindings::E*` usage here. This would ideally be split into two functions, one with all the logic returning `Result`, another just converting the `kernel::error::Error` to an errno integer.\n```\nfn wrapfd_get_mappable_internal(\n   file: \u0026File,\n   dev: \u0026Device,\n   mappable: \u0026mut bindings::wrapfd_mappable,\n) -\u003e Result\n```\nSimilar for `put_mappable`.",
      "revId": "116823e2b5429c6c20c8551f3d25aff4547cf65d",
